'''Ambrak''' is a [[Torricelli languages|Torricelli language]] spoken in [[Nuku District (Papua New Guinea)|Nuku District]] of [[Sandaun Province]] in [[Papua New Guinea]]. According to the 2000 census, there are 290 speakers.<ref name="e18"/>

